        "original_id": "6e9749d9-6945-5862-97d6-20cc60e35d0e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Splendid China Mall, Pacific Mall, Scarborough, Toronto, Ontario, Canada\n- Topics: shopping centres, locations, former names, former sites\n\nFacts:\n- Splendid China Mall was formerly known as Splendid China Tower.\n- Splendid China Mall is a 90,000 square foot Chinese-themed ethnic shopping centre.\n- Splendid China Mall is located at the southeast corner of Redlea Avenue and Steeles Avenue in the Scarborough district of Toronto, Ontario, Canada.\n- Pacific Mall is located on the northeast side of Steeles Avenue and Kennedy Road.\n- Pacific Mall is situated right across the municipal border from the city of Toronto.\n- Pacific Mall occupies a site that was formerly occupied by Cullen Country Barns.",
